  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></math>. The set&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;represents a</p>"
  },
  "options": [
