  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></math>&nbsp;and the set</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>:</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>,</p><p>Now putting the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>i</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>i</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>i</mi></math>&nbsp;in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>7</mn></math></p><p>Which is a straight line with intercept&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math>&nbsp;on&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi></math>&nbsp;axis, so sum of intercept will be&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>14</mn></math>.</p>"
  }
